{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATH IN ABYSS </strong>is an intense deep-sea flight shooter that blends elements from classics like <i>Star Fox 64</i>, <i>Devil Daggers</i>, and <i>Omega Boost</i> into a difficult action-horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/extras/ba2d61fc1e52a90cb8ecd1406cc1c8bc.poster.avif?t=1758649107\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/extras/ba2d61fc1e52a90cb8ecd1406cc1c8bc.webm?t=1758649107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/extras/ba2d61fc1e52a90cb8ecd1406cc1c8bc.mp4?t=1758649107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom through extraterrestrial seas against unidentified giants lurking in the dark depths. <br>In your descent, the nightmares can only get worse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raging lifeforms swarm towards you. Survive by using your reflexes and versatile movement. Eliminate hostiles with your powerful arsenal to harness their life-force and restore health. Progress deeper into the uncharted ocean, find the source of the outbreak. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying flight movement, designed for fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging campaign with creepy underwater dread.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique infectious creatures and disturbing environment design. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive nightmares to fight against. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX-inspired graphics with old terminal aesthetics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunchy old-school retro sounds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/extras/7c11c845aa8fd38da8a8349cf939096c.avif?t=1758649107\" width=616 height=924 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2076520?t=1758649107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758649107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/653e277305240a2054ae5712faa1bcc50537f928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758649107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/653e277305240a2054ae5712faa1bcc50537f928/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758649107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Death In Abyss contains retro inspired violence, blood and gore, as well as deep-sea horror themes and occasional nudity."},"demos":[{"appid":2984030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATH IN ABYSS </strong>is an intense deep-sea flight shooter that blends elements from classics like <i>Star Fox 64</i>, <i>Devil Daggers</i>, and <i>Omega Boost</i> into a difficult action-horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076520/extras/ba2d61fc1e52a90cb8ecd1406cc1c8bc.poster.avif?t=1758649107\" width=568 height=320 